- elements without
- /// reallocating.
- "If `capacity` is 0, the hash set"
- "will not allocate.\n    ///"
- "/// # HashDoS resistance\n    ///"
- "/// The `hash_builder` normally"
- use a fixed key by default and
- that does
- "/// not allow the `HashSet` to"
- be protected against attacks
- "such as [`HashDoS`]."
- /// Users who require HashDoS
- resistance should explicitly use
