- The collection may reserve more
- space to avoid
- /// frequent reallocations.
- "///\n    /// # Errors\n    ///"
- "/// If the capacity overflows,"
- or the allocator reports a
- "failure, then an error"
- "/// is returned.\n    ///"
- "/// # Examples\n    ///"
- "/// ```\n    /// use hashbrown::"
- HashSet;
