- "();\n    }\n\n    /// Shrinks the"
- capacity of the set with a lower
- limit. It will drop
- /// down no lower than the
- supplied limit while maintaining
- the internal rules
- /// and possibly leaving some
- space in accordance with the
- "resize policy.\n    ///"
- /// Panics if the current
- capacity is smaller than the
- supplied
- "/// minimum capacity.\n    ///"
- "/// # Examples\n    ///"
