- "min_capacity);\n    }"
- /// Visits the values
- "representing the difference,"
- "/// i.e., the values that are in"
- "`self` but not in `other`."
- "///\n    /// # Examples\n    ///"
- "/// ```\n    /// use hashbrown::"
- HashSet;
- "/// let a: HashSet<_> = [1, 2, 3"
- "].into_iter().collect();"
